helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3152830	29			0	tr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Options\</item\> tab, and then select “Apply numbering – symbol”.				20130618 17:22:18
