helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3147779	59			0	tr	Type a name that is longer than four characters. This allows you to use the \<emph\>Display remainder of name as suggestion while typing\</emph\> AutoText option. If you want, you can modify the proposed shortcut.				20130618 17:22:18
