helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3151355	50			0	tr	You can store AutoText entries in different directories on a network.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370	51			0	tr	For example, you can store "read-only" AutoText entries for your company on a central server, and user-defined AutoText entries in a local directory.				20130618 17:22:18
