helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3147395	15			0	tr	You can include chapter numbers in captions.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3147408	16			0	tr	Ensure that the text in your document is organized by chapters, and that the chapter titles and, if you want, the section titles, use one of the predefined heading paragraph styles. You must also assign a numbering option to the heading paragraph styles.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3154249	17			0	tr	Select the item that you want to add a caption to.				20130618 17:22:18
