helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3150527	19			0	tr	Select a caption title from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Category\</item\>               \<emph/\>box, and select a numbering style in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\>               \<emph/\>box. \<br/\>You also can enter a caption text in this dialog. If you want, enter text in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Caption\</item\>               \<emph/\>box.				20130618 17:22:18
