helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\delete_from_dict.xhp	0	help	par_id3153417	14			0	tr	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Writing Aids\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
