helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154079	1			0	tr	\<variable id=\"field_convert\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/field_convert.xhp\" name=\"Converting a Field into Text\"\>Converting a Field into Text\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281	2			0	tr	You can change a field to regular text, so that it is no longer updated. After you change a field to text, you cannot change the text back into a field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155608	7			0	tr	Select the field and choose \<emph\>Edit - Cut\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154238	9			0	tr	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste Special\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262	10			0	tr	Click "Unformatted text" in the\<emph/\>               \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Selection\</item\> list, and then click\<emph/\>               \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
