helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409	2			0	tr	An input field is a variable that you can click in a document to open a dialog where you can edit the variable.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3145776	3			0	tr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>               \<emph/\>and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Functions\</item\> tab.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620	5			0	tr	Click “Input field”\<emph/\>in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20130618 17:22:18
