helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3153167	101			0	tr	If you want, you can use a condition to hide specific text in your document from a specific user.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3153190	102			0	tr	Select the text in the document that you want to hide.				20130618 17:22:18
