helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150955	8			0	tr	Click 'Page' in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list and 'Next page' in the \<emph\>Select\</emph\> list.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150517	9			0	tr	Click a numbering style in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\>               \<emph/\>list.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537	10			0	tr	If you select 'Text' in the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> list, only the text that you enter in the \<emph\>Value\</emph\> box is displayed in the field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_nextpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150727	11			0	tr	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> to insert the field with the page number.				20130618 17:22:18
