helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3150534	3			0	tr	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Page Number\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3153155	4			0	tr	If you want, you can align the page number field as you would text.				20130618 17:22:18
