helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3153902	44			0	tr	Double-click in front of the variable that you used to define the condition for hiding the text, and enter a different value for the variable.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114	45			0	tr	Double-click in front of the hidden text field or the hidden paragraph field, and change the condition statement.				20130618 17:22:18
