helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3253883				0	tr	Choose Modify.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3196203				0	tr	For example, open the Borders tab page to set the thickness and style of the lines. Open the Indents & Spacing tab page to set the indents of the line.				20130618 17:22:18
