helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149685	3			0	tr	Press the keys \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+<underlined character> to open a menu. In an open menu, press the underlined character to run a command. For example, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+I to open the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> menu, and then T to insert a table.				20130618 17:22:18
