helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10812				0	tr	$[officename] uses page styles to specify the background of the pages in a document. For example, to change the page background of one or more pages in a document to a watermark, you need to create a page style that uses the watermark background, and then apply the page style to the pages.				20130618 17:22:18
