helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F6				0	tr	\<variable id=\"print_brochure\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/print_brochure.xhp\"\>Printing a Brochure\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10614				0	tr	You can print a Writer document as a brochure or a booklet. That is, Writer prints two pages on each side of the paper, so that when you fold the paper, you can read the document as a book.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DE				0	tr	When you create a document that you want to print as a brochure, use portrait orientation for the pages. Writer applies the brochure layout when you print the document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	tr	To Print a Brochure				20130618 17:22:18
