helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B6				0	tr	In the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, click \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070E				0	tr	In the properties dialog for your printer, set the paper orientation to landscape.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_id8947416				0	tr	If your printer prints duplex, and because brochures always print in landscape mode, you should use the "duplex - short edge" setting in your printer setup dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10628				0	tr	Return to \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, and click the \<emph\>Page Layout\</emph\> tab page.				20130618 17:22:18
