helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151182	17			0	tr	\<variable id=\"text_animation\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_animation.xhp\" name=\"Animating Text\"\>Animating Text\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3145080	18			0	tr	You can only animate text that is contained in a drawing object, such as rectangles, lines, or text objects. For example, draw a rectangle, then double-click the rectangle and enter your text.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811	19			0	tr	Select the drawing object containing the text that you want to animate.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178	20			0	tr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Object - Text Attributes\</item\>, and then click the\<emph/\>               \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text Animation\</item\> tab.				20130618 17:22:18
