helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3147414	22			0	tr	Automatic hyphenation inserts hyphens where they are needed in a paragraph. This option is only available for paragraph styles and individual paragraphs.				20130618 17:22:18
