helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10711				0	tr	When you press Enter in a numbered or bulleted list, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically numbers the next paragraph. To remove the numbering or bullet from the new paragraph, press Enter again.				20130618 17:22:18
