helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072F				0	tr	To change the bullets or numbering format for the current paragraph only, select a character or word in the paragraph, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a new format. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10733				0	tr	To change the bullet or numbering format for all paragraphs in the list, ensure that the cursor is in the list, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a new format. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	tr	To apply the same bullet or numbering format to all paragraphs in the list, select all paragraphs, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a format.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073A				0	tr	You can also use the commands on the \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Numbering Object Bar\"\>Bullets and Numbering\</link\> toolbar to edit a numbered or bulleted list. To change the numbering or bullet format, click the \<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\> icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153123	34			0	tr	To Apply Numbering With a Paragraph Style				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153137	31			0	tr	Paragraph Styles give you greater control over numbering that you apply in a document. When you change the numbering format of the style, all paragraphs using the style are automatically updated.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149646	35			0	tr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paragraph Styles\</item\>               \<emph/\>icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149599	36			0	tr	Right-click the paragraph style that you want to apply numbering to, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149850	37			0	tr	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Outline & Numbering\</item\>               \<emph/\>tab.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149874	38			0	tr	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering Style\</item\> box, select the type of numbering that you want to use.				20130618 17:22:18
