helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B53				0	tr	Now the list is also valid for other documents that you open. When you close the last %PRODUCTNAME document, the word list is deleted.				20130618 17:22:18
