helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3159197	19			0	tr	The advantage of entering a cross-reference as a field is that you do not have to adjust the references manually every time you change the document. Just update the fields with F9 and the references in the document are updated too.				20130618 17:22:18
