helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3148863	30			0	tr	<SDFIELD TYPE=DOCINFO SUBTYPE=COMMENT SDFIXED>Description</SDFIELD>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3151083	31			0	tr	Creation date				20130618 17:22:18
