helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155904	12			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_SEC_KEY\"\>Makes the current selection a sub-subentry of the 1st key. For example, if you select "cold", and enter "weather" as the 1st key and "winter" as the 2nd key, the index entry is "weather, winter, cold".\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
