helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	7			0	tr	The \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line defines how the entries in the index are composed. To change the appearance of an entry you can enter codes or text in the empty boxes on this line. You can also click in an empty box or on a code, and then click a code button.				20130618 17:22:18
