helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940	13			0	tr	To delete a column, place the cursor in the column that you want to delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Delete, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				20130618 17:22:18
