helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	tr	To \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dock\"\>dock\</link\> the Styles and Formatting window, drag its title bar to the left or to the right side of the workspace. To undock the window, double-click a free space on its toolbar.				20130618 17:22:18
