helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147401	2			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MergeTable\"\>Combines two consecutive tables into a single table. The tables must be directly next to each other and not separated by an empty paragraph.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146325	3			0	tr	If you choose this command when the cursor is in the middle of three consecutive tables, you are prompted to select the table that you want to merge with.				20130618 17:22:18
