helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152896	2			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShadowCursor\"\>Activates or deactivates the direct cursor.\</ahelp\> You can specify the behavior of the direct cursor by choosing \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
