helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id7874080				0	tr	Üstel regresyon denklemi				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4679097				0	tr	 For exponential trend lines a transformation to a linear model takes place. The optimal curve fitting is related to the linear model and the results are interpreted accordingly. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9112216				0	tr	Üstel regresyon aşağıdaki denklemlerle devam eder \<item type=\"literal\"\>y=b*exp(a*x)\</item\> veya \<item type=\"literal\"\>y=b*m^x\</item\>, denklemleri sırasıyla\<item type=\"literal\"\>ln(y)=ln(b)+a*x\</item\> veya \<item type=\"literal\"\>ln(y)=ln(b)+ln(m)*x\</item\> denklemlerine dönüştürülür.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4416638				0	tr	a = EĞİM(Veri_Y;LN(Veri_X)) 				20130618 17:22:18
