helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974	2			0	tr	\<variable id=\"gitter\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can divide the axes into sections by assigning gridlines to them. This allows you to get a better overview of the chart, especially if you are working with large charts.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The Y axis major grid is activated by default.				20130618 17:22:18
