helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\main.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147341				0	tr	\<bookmark_value\>$[officename] Math;general instructions\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>instructions; $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Equation Editor, see $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147341	1			0	tr	\<variable id=\"main\"\>\<link href=\"text/smath/guide/main.xhp\" name=\"Instructions for Using $[officename] Math\"\>$[officename] Math\</link\> Kullanımı için Eğitimler\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
