helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145750				0	tr	\<bookmark_value\>doubling draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>draw objects; duplicating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>duplicating draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>multiplying draw objects\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145750	3			0	tr	\<variable id=\"duplicate_object\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/duplicate_object.xhp\" name=\"Duplicating Objects\"\>Duplicating Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400	4			0	tr	You can create duplicate or multiple copies of an object. The copies can be identical or can differ in size, color, orientation and location.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415	5			0	tr	The following example creates a stack of coins by making multiple copies of a single ellipse.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149129	6			0	tr	Use the \<emph\>Ellipse\</emph\> tool to draw a solid yellow ellipse.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149209	8			0	tr	Select the ellipse and choose \<emph\>Edit - Duplicate\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145585	9			0	tr	Enter 12 as \<emph\>Number of copies.\</emph\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151192	11			0	tr	Enter a negative value for the \<emph\>Width\</emph\> and \<emph\>Height\</emph\> so that the coins decrease in size as you go up the stack.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387	39			0	tr	To define a color transition for the coins, select different colors in the \<emph\>Start\</emph\> and \<emph\>End\</emph\> boxes. The \<emph\>Start\</emph\> color is applied to the object that you are duplicating.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149947	12			0	tr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to create the duplicates.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153935	50			0	tr	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02120000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Duplicate\"\>Edit - Duplicate\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tr	Replacing Colors				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147436				0	tr	\<bookmark_value\>eyedropper tool\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>colors; replacing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>replacing;colors in bitmaps\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>metafiles;replacing colors\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bitmaps;replacing colors\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>GIF images;replacing colors\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147436	38			0	tr	\<variable id=\"eyedropper\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/eyedropper.xhp\" name=\"Replacing Colors\"\>Replacing Colors\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286	24			0	tr	You can replace colors in bitmaps with the \<emph\>Color Replacer\</emph\> tool.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3154704	25			0	tr	Up to four colors can be replaced at once.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3147344	26			0	tr	You can also use the \<emph\>Transparency\</emph\> option to replace the transparent areas of an image with a color.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488	27			0	tr	Similarly, you can use the \<emph\>Color Replacer\</emph\> to make a color on your image transparent.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150205	28			0	tr	To replace colors with the Color Replacer tool				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656	29			0	tr	Ensure that the image you are using is a bitmap (for example, BMP, GIF, JPG, or PNG) or a metafile (for example, WMF).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3150202	30			0	tr	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Color Replacer\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531	31			0	tr	Click the Color Replacer icon and position the mouse pointer over the color you want to replace in the image. The color appears in the box next to the icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3152985	32			0	tr	Click the color in the image. The color appears in the first \<emph\>Source color\</emph\> box and the check box next to the color is selected.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3148866	33			0	tr	In the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> box, select the new color.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3145362	41			0	tr	This replaces all occurrences of the \<emph\>Source color\</emph\> in the image.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3151191	34			0	tr	If you want to replace another color while the dialog is open, select the check box in front of \<emph\>Source color\</emph\> in the next row and repeat steps 3 to 5.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3149876	36			0	tr	Click \<emph\>Replace\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3157871	37			0	tr	If you want to expand or contract the color selection area, increase or decrease the tolerance of the \<emph\>Color Replacer\</emph\> tool and repeat your selection.				20130618 17:22:18
