helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663	13			0	tr	You can create and edit drawing objects using the keyboard.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3125863	12			0	tr	To Create and Edit a Drawing Object				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188	11			0	tr	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F6\</item\> to navigate to the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3146971	10			0	tr	Press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Right\</item\> arrow key until you reach the toolbar icon of a drawing tool.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	tr	If there is an arrow next to the icon, the drawing tool opens a sub toolbar. Press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Up\</item\> or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Down\</item\> arrow key to open the sub toolbar, then press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Right\</item\> or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Left\</item\> key to select an icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338	8			0	tr	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154705	7			0	tr	The object is created at the center of the current document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155962	6			0	tr	To return to the document, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155062	5			0	tr	You can use the arrow keys to position the object where you want. To choose a command from the context menu for the object, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift+F10\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150306	4			0	tr	To Select an Object				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152990	3			0	tr	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6\</item\> to enter the document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145587	2			0	tr	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Tab\</item\> until you reach the object you want to select.				20130618 17:22:18
