helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3150716	14			0	tr	Select the object you want to rotate. On the \<emph\>Mode\</emph\> toolbar in $[officename] Draw or on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar in $[officename] Impress, click the \<emph\>Rotate\</emph\> icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149021	69			0	tr	Move the pointer to a corner handle so that the pointer changes to a rotate symbol. Drag the handle to rotate the object.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id0930200803002335				0	tr	Hold down the Shift key to restrict the rotation to multiples of 15 degrees.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id0930200803002463				0	tr	Right-click the object to open the context menu. Choose Position and Size - Rotation to enter an exact rotation value.				20130618 17:22:18
