helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN1093C				0	tr	Using \<emph\>Paste special\</emph\>, you can choose the text format to be pasted. Depending on formats, you can copy different text attributes.				20130618 17:22:18
