helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069	2			0	tr	Reads a record from a relative file, or a sequence of bytes from a binary file, into a variable.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154346	3			0	tr	See also: \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020204.xhp\" name=\"PUT\"\>\<item type=\"literal\"\>PUT\</item\>\</link\> Statement				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150358	4			0	tr	Sözdizimi:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150792	5			0	tr	Get [#] FileNumber As Integer, [Position], Variable				20130618 17:22:18
