helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3151074	10			0	tr	\<emph\>FileNumber:\</emph\> The number of the file that was opened with the Open statement.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3144766	11			0	tr	\<emph\>Attribute:\</emph\> Integer expression that indicates the type of file information that you want to return. The following values are possible:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396	12			0	tr	1: The FileAttr-Function indicates the access mode of the file.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3149959	13			0	tr	2: The FileAttr-Function returns the file access number of the operating system.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154018	14			0	tr	If you specify a parameter attribute with a value of 1, the following return values apply:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3149124	15			0	tr	1 - INPUT (file open for input)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3156275	16			0	tr	2 - OUTPUT (file open for output)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3155066	17			0	tr	4 - RANDOM (file open for random access)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3148406	18			0	tr	8 - APPEND (file open for appending)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757	19			0	tr	32 - BINARY (file open in binary mode).				20130618 17:22:18
