helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156215	8			0	tr	Boolean expressions combined with AND only return the value \<emph\>True\</emph\> if both expressions evaluate to \<emph\>True\</emph\>:				20130618 17:22:18
