helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212	10			0	tr	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Any numerical expression that represents the ratio of two sides of a right triangle. The Atn function returns the corresponding angle in radians (arctangent).				20130618 17:22:18
