helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286	25			0	tr	Note: In nested \<emph\>For...Next\</emph\> loops, if you exit a loop unconditionally with \<emph\>Exit For\</emph\>, only one loop is exited.				20130618 17:22:18
