helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561	13			0	tr	Exits the subroutine immediately. Program execution continues with the statement that follows the \<emph\>Sub\</emph\> call.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3153143	14			0	tr	The Exit statement does not define the end of a structure, and must not be confused with the End statement.				20130618 17:22:18
