helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\02\11070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346	4			0	tr	The breakpoint is inserted at the cursor position. Use a breakpoint to interrupt a program just before an error occurs. You can then troubleshoot the program by running it in \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/02/11050000.xhp\" name=\"Single Step\"\>Single Step\</link\> mode until the error occurs. You can also use the \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/02/11080000.xhp\" name=\"Watch\"\>Watch\</link\> icon to check the content of the relevant variables.				20130618 17:22:18
