helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\html_export.xhp	0	help	par_id3148842	4			0	tr	Set the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> to \<emph\>HTML Document ($[officename] Impress) (.html;.htm)\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
