helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148769	24			0	tr	Move to the slide where you want to paste the copied slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+V\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148388	25			0	tr	Select \<emph\>Before \</emph\>or \<emph\>After\</emph\> the current slide, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155367	26			0	tr	Moving a slide:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155987	27			0	tr	Use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide that you want to move, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+X\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
