helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152596	13			0	tr	\<variable id=\"masterpage\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/masterpage.xhp\" name=\"Applying a Slide Design to a Slide Master\"\>Applying a Slide Design to a Slide Master\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017	14			0	tr	Every slide in a presentation has exactly one slide master, also known as master page. A slide master determines the text formatting style for the title and outline and the background design for all slides that use this slide master.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149018	25			0	tr	To apply a new slide master				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702	19			0	tr	Select \<emph\>Format - Slide Design\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3148485	20			0	tr	Click \<emph\>Load\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384	21			0	tr	Under \<emph\>Categories\</emph\>, select a slide design category.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3153915	26			0	tr	Under \<emph\>Templates\</emph\>, select a template with the design that you want to apply. To preview the template, click \<emph\>More\</emph\>, and then select the \<emph\>Preview \</emph\>box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154652	27			0	tr	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145115	28			0	tr	Do one of the following:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150436	18			0	tr	To apply the slide design to all of the slides in your presentation, select the \<emph\>Exchange background page\</emph\> check box, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
