helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079C				0	tr	More animations may be present, which run when a shape is shown. If any of these animated shapes are present, they are listed in the lower half of the animation list. Tabs display the name of each shape that runs an animation.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079F				0	tr	Each list entry can consist of the following columns, from left to right:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A5				0	tr	An optional + character signals that the text paragraphs are animated.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A9				0	tr	The second column shows the execution number of the animation.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AD				0	tr	Column three shows a mouse icon if the animation is started by a mouse click, and a clock if the animation starts after the previous animation ends.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B1				0	tr	In column four, an icon shows the animation effect.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B5				0	tr	The fifth column shows the name of the shape for this animation effect and optionally the first characters of animated text.				20130618 17:22:18
