helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974	2			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Combine\"\>Combines two or more selected objects into a single shape.\</ahelp\>Unlike \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290000.xhp\" name=\"grouping\"\>grouping\</link\>, a combined object takes on the properties of the lowermost object in the stacking order. You can \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13150000.xhp\" name=\"split\"\>split\</link\> apart combined objects, but the original object properties are lost.				20130618 17:22:18
