helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3139133				0	tr	Different methods exist to start a chart:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6772972				0	tr	Insert a chart based on data from cells in Calc or Writer.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6049684				0	tr	These charts update automatically when the source data changes.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id2356944				0	tr	Insert a chart with a default data set, and then use the Data Table dialog to enter your own data for that chart.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id866115				0	tr	These charts can be created in Writer, Impress and Draw. 				20130618 17:22:18
