helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copy_drawfunctions.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147573	34			0	tr	Inserting into a text document				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copy_drawfunctions.xhp	0	help	par_id3150276	35			0	tr	An inserted drawing object is anchored to the current paragraph. You can change the anchor by selecting the object and clicking the \<emph\>Change Anchor\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>OLE-Object\</emph\> toolbar or the \<emph\>Frame\</emph\> toolbar. This opens a popup menu where you can select the anchor type.				20130618 17:22:18
