helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytext2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3149655	8			0	tr	If you drag text to the normal view of a presentation, an OLE object is inserted as a $[officename] plug-in.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytext2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793	11			0	tr	If you drag the text to the outline view of a presentation, it will be inserted at the cursor location.				20130618 17:22:18
