helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_id3150985	14			0	tr	To restrict the display of files in the \<emph\>Open\</emph\> dialog to a certain type select the corresponding \<emph\>File type\</emph\> from the list. Select \<emph\>All Files (*.*)\</emph\> to display all files.				20130618 17:22:18
