helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_id3153126	9			0	tr	You can enter a URL in the \<emph\>File name\</emph\> box of the \<emph\>Open\</emph\> dialogs. The URL must start with file:/// or ftp:// or http://. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200803501548				0	tr	If you use the %PRODUCTNAME dialog, you can use the https:// prefix for a secure connection, and you can save a document on the web server.				20130618 17:22:18
