helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\export_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084	2			0	tr	Choose \<emph\>File - Save as\</emph\>. You will see the \<emph\>Save as\</emph\> dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\export_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3153348	3			0	tr	In the \<emph\>Save as type\</emph\> or \<emph\>File type\</emph\> list box, select the desired format.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\export_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3150985	4			0	tr	Enter a name in the \<emph\>File name\</emph\> box and click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
