helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119	32			0	tr	Option 2: Open \<link href=\"text/shared/main0209.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink Bar\"\>Hyperlink Bar\</link\> (\<emph\>View - Toolbars - Hyperlink Bar\</emph\>). Click on the hyperlink, do not release the mouse button and drag the hyperlink to the Hyperlink Bar. Edit the URL on the Hyperlink Bar and press the Return key.				20130618 17:22:18
