helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152473	31			0	tr	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6 to switch to the document.				20130618 17:22:18
