helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3154164	20			0	tr	In \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc, choose \<emph\>Format - Cells\</emph\> and proceed accordingly.				20130618 17:22:18
