helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	hd_id2486342				0	tr	Limitations of the macro recorder				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3608508				0	tr	The following actions are \<emph\>not\</emph\> recorded:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id921353				0	tr	Opening of windows is not recorded.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id9296243				0	tr	Actions carried out in another window than where the recorder was started are not recorded.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id4269234				0	tr	Window switching is not recorded.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id8014465				0	tr	Actions that are not related to the document contents are not recorded. For example, changes made in the Options dialog, macro organizer, customizing.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id2814416				0	tr	Selections are recorded only if they are done by using the keyboard (cursor traveling), but not when the mouse is used.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id2522354				0	tr	The macro recorder works only in Calc and Writer.				20130618 17:22:18
