helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148672	17			0	tr	Open the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> box and select the appropriate filter.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419	18			0	tr	Enter a name and click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
