helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3149807	18			0	tr	From now on, if you save a document, the \<emph\>File type \</emph\>will be set according to your choice. Of course, you still can select another file type in the file save dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156423	19			0	tr	Opening Microsoft Office Files by Default				20130618 17:22:18
