helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10743				0	tr	Contents that are stored on the clipboard can be pasted into your document using different formats. In %PRODUCTNAME you can choose how to paste the contents using a dialog or a drop-down icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10746				0	tr	The available options depend on the contents of the clipboard.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144547360				0	tr	In Writer text documents, you can press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+V to paste the contents of the clipboard as unformatted text.				20130618 17:22:18
