helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10774				0	tr	If you are in a spreadsheet and the contents of the clipboard are spreadsheet cells, then a different \<emph\>Paste Special\</emph\> dialog appears. Use the \<emph\>Paste Special\</emph\> dialog to copy cells using basic or advanced options.				20130618 17:22:18
