helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10778				0	tr	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\> to create a new menu assignment. The new menu entry appears in the \<emph\>Entries\</emph\> list box.				20130618 17:22:18
