helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10757				0	tr	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\"\>Form Controls toolbar\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075F				0	tr	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/xformsdata.xhp\"\>Data Navigator\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
