helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id10				0	tr	For JPEG files you can set the color depth and the quality.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id435923952				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select the color depth from 8 bit grayscale or 24 bit true color.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id355152952				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the compression and quality for the export. Choose from a low quality with minimal file size, up to a high quality and big file size. A high compression means a low quality, a low compression means a high quality.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id11				0	tr	For BMP files you can set the compression and the RLE encoding.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id312346798				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Applies RLE (Run Length Encoding) to the BMP graphics.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id12				0	tr	For PBM, PGM, and PPM files you can set the encoding.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id344441				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Exports the file in binary format. The resulting file is smaller than a text file.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id3555783				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Exports the file in ASCII text format. The resulting file is larger than a binary file.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id13				0	tr	For PNG files you can set the compression and the interlaced mode.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id35674840				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether the graphic is to be saved in interlaced mode.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id14				0	tr	For GIF files you can set the transparency and the interlaced mode.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id31456456938				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to save the background of the picture as transparent. Only objects will be visible in the GIF image. Use the Color Replacer to set the transparent color in the picture.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id15				0	tr	For EPS files you can set the preview, the color format, the compression, and the version.				20130618 17:22:18
