helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id993155271				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether a preview image is exported in the TIFF format together with the actual PostScript file.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
