helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200901194137				0	tr	Press Shift+F1 or choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help - What's This?\</item\> and point to any control element in the Print dialog to see an extended help text.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912284914				0	tr	Önizleme				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id081820091228505				0	tr	The preview shows how each sheet of paper will look. You can browse through all sheets of paper with the buttons below the preview.				20130618 17:22:18
