helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149167	175			0	tr	Represents any of the characters that are between a and e, including both start and end characters				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id100520090232005				0	tr	The characters are ordered by their code numbers.				20130618 17:22:18
