helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id9851680				0	tr	Inserting comments				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id1830500				0	tr	In Writer, the command \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Comment\</item\> or the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C key combination inserts a comment anchor at the current cursor position. A comment box is shown at the page margin, where you can enter the text of your comment. A line connects anchor and comment box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200910571516				0	tr	In Calc, Draw, and Impress, the command \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Comment\</item\> inserts a comment.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id1831				0	tr	Yazar ismi notun yaratıldığı tarih ve saat, not kutusunun altında görüntülenir.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id6718649				0	tr	The comments by different authors get different colors. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - User Data\</item\> to enter your name so that it can show up as the comment author.				20130618 17:22:18
