helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BD				0	tr	A file dialog opens where you can select the extension that you want to add. To copy and to register the selected extension, click Open.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id4856410				0	tr	An extension can show a license dialog. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Read the license. Click the Scroll Down button to scroll down if necessary. Click Accept to continue the installation of the extension.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
