helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3154841	2			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\"\"\>Assign a master password to protect the access to a saved password.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3146857	3			0	tr	You can save some passwords for the duration of a session, or permanently to a file protected by a master password.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3147000	6			0	tr	You must enter the master password to access a file or service that is protected by a saved password. You only need to enter the master password once during a session.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id0608200910545958				0	tr	You should only use passwords that are hard to find by other persons or programs. A password should follow these rules:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id0608200910545989				0	tr	Length of eight or more characters.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id0608200910545951				0	tr	Contains a mix of lower case and upper case letters, numbers, and special characters.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id0608200910545923				0	tr	Cannot be found in any wordbook or encyclopedia.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id0608200910550049				0	tr	Has no direct relation to your personal data, e.g., date of birth or car plate.				20130618 17:22:18
