helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151378	2			0	tr	\<variable id=\"formulartext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Config\"\>The Form Controls toolbar contains tools that you need to create an interactive form.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can use the toolbar to add controls to a form in a text, spreadsheet, presentation, or HTML document, for example a button that runs a macro.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id1027200809391346				0	tr	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Toolbars - Form Controls\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336	68			0	tr	Icon on the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> toolbar (you may need to enable this initially invisible icon):				20130618 17:22:18
