helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148534	13			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Label\"\>Creates a field for displaying text.\</ahelp\> These labels are only for displaying predefined text. Entries cannot be made in these fields.				20130618 17:22:18
