helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155399	32			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TimeField\"\>Creates a time field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the time values for the form can be adopted from the database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154764	64			0	tr	Time fields can be easily edited by the user with the up and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the hours, minutes, or the seconds are increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				20130618 17:22:18
