helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151300	120			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_STRINGITEMLIST\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Defines the list entries visible in the document. Open this list and type your text. Use Shift+Enter for a new line. With list and combo boxes, you can define the list entries that will be visible in the document. Open the \<emph\>List entries\</emph\> field and type your text.\</ahelp\> Please note the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170100.xhp\" name=\"tips\"\>tips\</link\> referring to the keyboard controls.				20130618 17:22:18
