helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146325	192			0	tr	The name is also used to group different controls that belong together functionally, such as radio buttons. To do so, give the same name to all members of the group: controls with identical names form a group. Grouped controls can be represented visually by using a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"Group Box\"\>Group Box\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
