helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN1114D				0	tr	Drop-down list items are updated according to the change. The edit field of the combo box and the linked cell are not changed.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN11163				0	tr	Contents of the linked cell				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN11167				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CELL_EXCHANGE_TYPE\"\>Select the mode of linking a list box with a linked cell on a spreadsheet.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN11179				0	tr	Linked contents: Synchronize the text contents of the selected list box entry with the cell contents. Select "The selected entry"				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN1117D				0	tr	Linked selection position: The position of the single selected item in the list box is synchronized with the numerical value in the cell. Select "Position of the selected entry"				20130618 17:22:18
