helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN111A1				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LIST_CELL_RANGE\"\>Enter a cell range that contains the entries for a list box or combo box on a spreadsheet.\</ahelp\> If you enter a multi-column range, only the contents of the leftmost column are used to fill the control.				20130618 17:22:18
