helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364	2			0	tr	The following comparative operators can be set under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Standard Filter\</item\> dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313	3			0	tr	                  \<emph\>Comparative operator\</emph\>               				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089	4			0	tr	                  \<emph\>Effect\</emph\>               				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209	5			0	tr	Equal (=)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797	6			0	tr	Shows values equal to the condition.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271	7			0	tr	Less than (<)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153761	8			0	tr	Shows values less than the condition.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146807	9			0	tr	Greater than (>)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852	10			0	tr	Shows values greater than the condition.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342	11			0	tr	Less than or equal to (< =)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154381	12			0	tr	Shows values that are less than or equal to the condition.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823	13			0	tr	Greater than or equal to (> =)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143	14			0	tr	Shows values that are greater than or equal to the condition.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811	15			0	tr	Not equal (< >)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944	16			0	tr	Shows the values not equal to the condition.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669	17			0	tr	En büyük				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413	18			0	tr	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) largest values.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054	19			0	tr	En küçük				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657	20			0	tr	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) smallest values.				20130618 17:22:18
