helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434	107			0	tr	The\<emph\> Form \</emph\>combo box is only visible if the current document is a form document with more than one logical form. It does not appear during a search in tables or queries.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384	108			0	tr	Form documents may contain multiple logical forms. These are individual form components, which are each linked to a table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145086	109			0	tr	The \<emph\>Form\</emph\> combo box contains the names of all logical forms for which controls exist.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159414	11			0	tr	Tüm alanlar				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153896	12			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SEARCH_ALLFIELDS\"\>Searches through all fields.\</ahelp\> If you are running a search in a table, all fields in the table will be searched. If you are running a search in a form, all fields of the logical form (entered under \<emph\>Form\</emph\>) will be searched. If you are running a search in a table control field, all columns that are linked to a valid database table field will be searched.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054	13			0	tr	Note that the fields of the current logical form do not have to be identical to the fields of the form document. If the form document contains fields that point to multiple data sources (that is, multiple logical forms), the \<emph\>All Fields\</emph\> option will only search for the fields linked to data sources in the form document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150865	15			0	tr	Tek alan				20130618 17:22:18
