helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148673	20			0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SEARCH_POSITION\"\>Specifies the relationship of the search term and the field contents.\</ahelp\> The following options are available:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280	21			0	tr	anywhere in the field				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145744	22			0	tr	Returns all fields containing the search pattern anywhere in the field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451	23			0	tr	beginning of field				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155429	24			0	tr	Returns all fields containing the search pattern at the beginning of the field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131	74			0	tr	end of field				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726	75			0	tr	Returns all fields containing the search pattern at the end of the field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147317	25			0	tr	entire field				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154127	26			0	tr	Returns all fields containing the search pattern as an exact match to the contents of the field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152886	27			0	tr	If the \<emph\>Wildcard expression\</emph\> check box is marked, this function is not available.				20130618 17:22:18
