helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150365	44			0	tr	"?loppy" returns "Floppy"				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3166426	65			0	tr	"M?ller" returns, for example, Miller and Moller				20130618 17:22:18
