helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154718	67			0	tr	Searching with regular expressions offers more options than searching with wildcard expressions. If you search with regular expressions, the following characters correspond to those used in searches with wildcards:				20130618 17:22:18
