helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873	2			0	tr	On the ruler, set the tabs for the current paragraph, or all selected paragraphs, using the mouse.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520	3			0	tr	Initially the default tabs are shown on the horizontal ruler. Once you set a tab, only the default tabs to the right of the tab that you have set are available.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	tr	Setting Indents, Margins, and Columns				20130618 17:22:18
