helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148453	17			0	tr	Tabs that have been set are not changed when indenting a paragraph. If the set tabs end up outside the margins of the paragraph, they are no longer displayed, but they still exist.				20130618 17:22:18
