helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3158444	62			0	tr	You can choose which file format will be applied as the default when saving documents of various document types. If you always exchange your documents with other persons who use Microsoft Office, for example, you may specify here that %PRODUCTNAME only uses the Microsoft Office file formats as a default.				20130618 17:22:18
