helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730	79			0	tr	\<variable id=\"ignore\"\>The \<emph\>IgnoreAllList (All) \</emph\>includes all words that have been marked with \<emph\>Ignore\</emph\> during spellcheck. This list is valid only for the current spellcheck. \</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757	80			0	tr	The \<emph\>IgnoreAllList\</emph\> entry cannot be selected and cannot be deleted. Only the words included as content can be deleted. This happens automatically each time that $[officename] is closed.				20130618 17:22:18
