helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\testaccount.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	tr	When you enter settings on the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/mailmerge.xhp\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Mail Merge E-mail\</link\> tab page, you can click the \<emph\>Test Settings\</emph\> button to test your settings.				20130618 17:22:18
