helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146958	4			0	tr	Depending on the context, it is possible that not all the functions for your current database are listed in the context menus. For example, the \<emph\>Relationships\</emph\> command for defining relationships between various tables is only available with relational databases.				20130618 17:22:18
