helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909	30			0	tr	CREATE TABLE "table1" ("id" INTEGER AUTO_INCREMENT)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933	31			0	tr	In other words, enter AUTO_INCREMENT into \<emph\>Auto-increment statement\</emph\> box.				20130618 17:22:18
