helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id7868892				0	tr	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Moves the selected field down in the list.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
